# Terrain Control Logic Subsystem (ESP32 Firmware)

Embedded C++ firmware for the **Terrain Control Logic Module** of the Dynamic Variable-Terrain Putting Surface senior design project. Built on the ESP32-D0WD-V3 using PlatformIO and FreeRTOS, this module handles thread-safe Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) command parsing, EMA-filtered pneumatic pressure feedback, multi-channel valve/relay sequencing, and fail-safe timeout enforcement.

## System Architecture

```text
├── platformio.ini          # PlatformIO build configuration (esp32dev, 115200 baud)
├── README.md               # Subsystem architecture, wiring, and demo protocol
└── src/
    ├── config.h            # Hardware GPIO mapping, ADC calibration, and TBR01 constants
    ├── ble_manager.h       # Thread-safe BLE UART interface declarations
    ├── ble_manager.cpp     # Nordic UART Service (NUS) GATT server & FreeRTOS RX queue
    └── main.cpp            # Non-blocking state machine, command validator, and ADC filter
